10 REM BENCH - RUGG/FELDMAN BENCHMARKS BM1 AND BM2 (KILOBAUD 1977)
20 REM TIME FROM S TO E. BM1 IS 1000 EMPTY FOR/NEXT PASSES,
30 REM BM2 IS 1000 PASSES OF K=K+1 AND IF K<1000 (2000 STATEMENTS).
100 PRINT "BM1 S"
110 FOR K=1 TO 1000
120 NEXT K
130 PRINT "BM1 E"
200 PRINT "BM2 S"
210 K=0
220 K=K+1
230 IF K<1000 THEN 220
240 PRINT "BM2 E"
